{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39909","headline":"览柳浑汀洲采白苹之什因成一章 · 徐夤","name":"览柳浑汀洲采白苹之什因成一章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采尽汀苹恨别离，鸳鸯鸂鶒总双飞。\n月明南浦梦初断，花落洞庭人未归。\n天远有书随驿使，夜长无烛照寒机。\n年来泣泪知多少，重叠成痕在绣衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}